---
import AustraliaMap from './AustraliaMap.astro';
---
<section class="research" id="research"><div class="wrap">
 <p class="eyebrow rv">SDAHC Research</p><h2 class="sec-h rv d2">The intelligence behind every decision.</h2>
 <p class="sec-lead rv d2">Abundant public data, almost no commercial interpretation. Our SDA Market Report 2026 changes that by combining NDIS data with proprietary transaction evidence across every Australian jurisdiction.</p>
 <AustraliaMap />
 <div class="rstats"><div class="rv"><div class="n" data-target="13779">0</div><div class="k">Enrolled dwellings tracked</div></div>
  <div class="rv d2"><div class="n" data-target="8">0</div><div class="k">Jurisdictions analysed</div></div>
  <div class="rv d2"><div class="n">2019–26</div><div class="k">Proprietary transaction data</div></div>
  <div class="rv d3"><div class="n" data-target="76">0</div><div class="k">Pages of market intelligence</div></div></div>
</div></section>
<style>
.research{padding:104px 0;background:radial-gradient(1100px 560px at 20% 20%,rgba(4,118,217,.10),transparent 60%),var(--navy)}
.rstats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:28px;margin-top:56px}
.rstats .n{font-family:var(--cond);font-weight:600;font-size:clamp(34px,4vw,52px);color:#fff;line-height:.9}
.rstats .k{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px}
@media(max-width:860px){.rstats{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}
@media(max-width:520px){.rstats{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
